      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117194235745203430</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 05:55:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The whole point of digital is to facilitate duplication, distribution and storage of products, not to remove customers rights. There’s a thing called DRM-free version where you do in fact own it as long as you keep it safe. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamerant.com/sony-playstation-digital-ownership-licenses-impossible/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;gamerant.com/sony-playstation-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;digital-ownership-licenses-impossible/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
