    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117172424618445101</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117172424618445101</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 09:28:31 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I played KH1 and 2 back in the day and I couldn&amp;#39;t understand what was happening tbh, I was just there for the fun gameplay. But that&amp;#39;s also probably why I never went back to KH3, by that time I had found similar gameplay on other titles and the story was too complex already.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://cdn.masto.host/mastodongamedevplace/media_attachments/files/117/172/424/569/011/198/original/ffa945d72652b625.png" type="image/png" fileSize="74477" medium="image">
        <media:rating scheme="urn:simple">nonadult</media:rating>
        <media:description type="plain">Kingdom Hearts' Story Has Gotten So Complex That Tetsuya Nomura Says Square Enix Hired a Loremaster to Keep the Plot Cohesive</media:description>
      </media:content>
    </item>
