      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 14:46:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Next week Quest of Dungeons is getting a Nintendo Switch 2 update release with mouse mode support and a few more surprises. You can change between normal controls or mouse at any time! I&amp;#39;ll post more info later. &lt;a href="https://mastodon.gamedev.place/tags/indiedev" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;indiedev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://cdn.masto.host/mastodongamedevplace/media_attachments/files/117/128/413/843/972/775/original/2ff1d7f520198418.mp4" type="video/mp4" fileSize="7641051" medium="image">
        <media:rating scheme="urn:simple">nonadult</media:rating>
        <media:description type="plain">A Nintendo Switch 2 playing the game Quest of Dungeons, showing the game using dual joycon mode and switching to mouse more where it's possible to use menus and attack monsters</media:description>
      </media:content>
      <category>indiedev</category>
    </item>
